/P 113 0 R
/T (The To-Do List is a Python programming project developed as part of the DecodeLabs Industrial Training. The main purpose of this project is to create a simple program for managing tasks. The program allows the user to add tasks and store them in a Python list. The stored tasks can then be displayed to the user. The project focuses on basic Python data management using lists, the append\(\) method, and loops.)
/E (The To-Do List is a Python programming project developed as part of the DecodeLabs Industrial Training. The main purpose of this project is to create a simple program for managing tasks. The program allows the user to add tasks and store them in a Python list. The stored tasks can then be displayed to the user. The project focuses on basic Python data management using lists, the append\(\) method, and loops.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
